    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "An update is available for libxslt.\nThis update affects Rocky Linux 8.\nA Common Vulnerability Scoring System (CVSS) base score, which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVE list",
        "title": "Topic"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "libxslt is a library for transforming XML files into other textual formats (including HTML, plain text, and other XML representations of the underlying data) using the standard XSLT stylesheet transformation mechanism. \n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* libxslt: Use-After-Free in libxslt numbers.c (CVE-2025-24855)\n\n* libxslt: Use-After-Free in libxslt (xsltGetInheritedNsList) (CVE-2024-55549)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nThis advisory is provided by Ctrl IQ, Inc for Rocky Linux systems. For more information about CIQ security practices, visit https://ciq.com/security.",
        "title": "Description"
      },
      {
